      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6053e181e93e7c49c4a3279d|full_name}: yeah thats the \"username\" part of a vrchat account. Thats the one you signed up with.\n\"displayName\" is the one that becomes prominent when you actually \"change your name\".",
