  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-03-19T16:13:21.136Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A user's profile page shows their account name with no way to change or hide that. Many people share account names across multiple services and its forced revelation can become a vector for harassment to follow a user from VRC to other services. There are also many cases where a person would like to change their account name and, barring that, hide it.\nPlease either make it not show by default or allow a toggle so one could choose not to show their account name on the website",
